      "The thorns are big and sharp. The forest grows higher and higher every year. Soon, the forest covers the entire palace. No one can see the walls or the towers anymore. Only the top of the tallest tower can be seen from far away.",
      "In the neighboring kingdoms, people tell stories about the sleeping palace.",
      "\"A beautiful princess is sleeping inside,\" they say. \"Her name is Sleeping Beauty. She sleeps for a hundred years.\"",
